      },
      "cr": 3,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>The Regal Lion packet sheet — Regal Lion Chaplain.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/regal-lion.json</code> (entry <code>regal-lion-chaplain</code>): Medium humanoid (human), Lawful Neutral; CR 3 (proficiency +2, to hit +4 with STR); AC 16 (scale mail & Silver Flame shield), hit points 45 (7d8+14), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the The Regal Lion article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>Ordained at Flamekeep to administer the Regal Lion's daily liturgies, blessing weapons and consecrating estate rooms against corruption.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> combat cleric · <strong>tier:</strong> Flamekeep Chaplain · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Regal Lion Knights.</p><h3>Art</h3><p><strong>Awaiting its plate.</strong> The render <code>npc-forge/regal-lion/renders/regal-lion-chaplain.png</code> has not been cut yet; run the NPC Forge (or <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py plates regal-lion</code>) and rebuild. Seed 610007. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, polished steel and gold lion crest heraldry, dark navy blue and crimson surcoats, cold iron plate, flat colours, crisp shading. A solemn priest in grey clerical robes worn over polished chainmail armor, holding an aloft Silver Flame holy symbol on an ornate steel mace and a swinging incense censer. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
